      "id": "claim_0a8d4802bb4f401499fa8d3602c58283",
      "statement": "Process.classify validates threshold as an integer 1-10 and runs classify_async; layers of extractors are tried in order with asyncio.gather, CONSENSUS requires identical names, HIGHER_ORDER returns the max-confidence response from the first layer, CONSENSUS_WITH_THRESHOLD requires unanimity plus confidence >= threshold, layer errors are printed and skipped, and exhausting all layers raises ValueError('No consensus could be reached ...').",
      "evidence": [
